<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-gierer-hydra-activator-inhibitor> a pk:Claim ;
    rdfs:label "Gierer & Meinhardt (1972) & Meinhardt (1993) Hydra vulgaris activator-inhibitor morphogenesis, head regeneration & tentacle ring (Freshwater cnidarian polyp (Hydra vulgaris) apical hypostome polarity, surgical head regeneration & 6-tentacle sub-hypostomal ring)",
        "Gierer & Meinhardt (1972) & Meinhardt (1993) Hydra vulgaris activator-inhibitor morphogenesis, head regeneration & tentacle ring faithfully reproduces Freshwater cnidarian polyp (Hydra vulgaris) apical hypostome polarity, surgical head regeneration & 6-tentacle sub-hypostomal ring morphology" ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/gierer-hydra-activator-inhibitor-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/gierer-hydra-activator-inhibitor-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/gierer-hydra-activator-inhibitor-3> ;
    dct:description "The simulation script(s) 1972-gierer-hydra-activator-inhibitor.py implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real Freshwater cnidarian polyp (Hydra vulgaris) apical hypostome polarity, surgical head regeneration & 6-tentacle sub-hypostomal ring specimens and the source authors' figures. A belief under audit, not a fact: its credibility is the weight of evidence (MorphoEval 0.1.0 overall 91.8/100, audit 2026-10-19-hydra-activator-inhibitor-audit-v2) and the assessments." ;
    dct:subject <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/3cb5ea9/1972-gierer-hydra-activator-inhibitor.py> ;
    schema:about "Freshwater cnidarian polyp (Hydra vulgaris) apical hypostome polarity, surgical head regeneration & 6-tentacle sub-hypostomal ring" ;
