<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-gierer-hydra-activator-inhibitor-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Gierer & Meinhardt (1972) & Meinhardt (1993) Hydra vulgaris activator-inhibitor morphogenesis, head regeneration & tentacle ring — Model fidelity to source: 94/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Faithfully implements Gierer & Meinhardt (1972) Eqs. (15a)-(15b) activator-inhibitor PDE with exact homogeneous steady state (a_*=1.5, h_*=2.25), reaction Jacobian J_0 (tr=-0.01 < 0, det=+0.0006 > 0), critical diffusivity ratio d_c = (sqrt(2)+1)^2 = 5.828427, intact polar column apical dominance (Fig. 2), surgical bisection and autonomous basal-fragment head regeneration (Fig. 3, L304-366, 87.4% peak recovery), and Meinhardt (1993) periodic sub-hypostomal tentacle-ring formation (L369-469) paired with an equal-diffusion negative control (D_a=D_h=0.015). Backed by 3 machine-checked Lean 4 theorems in `Loop_001_hydra_activator_inhibitor.lean`." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-gierer-hydra-activator-inhibitor-model-fidelity-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-gierer-hydra-activator-inhibitor-model-fidelity-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-gierer-hydra-activator-inhibitor-model-fidelity-3> ;
    pk:hasScore 9.4e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-gierer-hydra-activator-inhibitor-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Gierer & Meinhardt (1972) & Meinhardt (1993) Hydra vulgaris activator-inhibitor morphogenesis, head regeneration & tentacle ring — Morphometric validation: 91/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "`measure_morphoeval()` (L918-998) computes 7 quantitative morphometrics with literature/specimen reference values, uncertainty statistics (CV, std, RMSE, Pearson r), and negative-control delta: d_c = 5.8284 (ref 5.8284), a_* = 1.5 (ref 1.5), intact apical peak index 0 (ref 0), bisection regeneration recovery ratio 0.8744 (ref 0.875, 161x amplification over pre-cut basal tissue), periodic tentacle ring count 6 vs segmented Hydra vulgaris specimen 6 tentacles (PDE spacing 10.67 +- 0.47 cells, CV = 0.0442; specimen gap 60.0 deg, CV = 0.1404), equal-diffusion control std = 1.80e-15 (0 peaks), and domain scaling r = 0.9823 (RMSE = 0.422 peaks)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/morphometric-validation" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-gierer-hydra-activator-inhibitor-measurement-allometric-domain-length-scaling-correlation-r-l-n-peaks>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-gierer-hydra-activator-inhibitor-measurement-equal-diffusion-negative-control-d-a-d-h-0-015-activator-spatial-std>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-gierer-hydra-activator-inhibitor-measurement-gierer-meinhardt-critical-diffusivity-ratio-d-c-sqrt-2-1-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-gierer-hydra-activator-inhibitor-measurement-homogeneous-steady-state-activator-concentration-a-rho-0-0>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-gierer-hydra-activator-inhibitor-measurement-intact-hydra-polar-column-apical-hypostome-peak-cell-index-n-40>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-gierer-hydra-activator-inhibitor-measurement-sub-hypostomal-periodic-ring-tentacle-primordia-count-vs-hydra-vulgaris-specimen>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-gierer-hydra-activator-inhibitor-measurement-surgical-bisection-basal-fragment-head-regeneration-recovery-ratio>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-gierer-hydra-activator-inhibitor-morphometric-validation-1> ;
    pk:hasScore 9.1e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-gierer-hydra-activator-inhibitor-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Gierer & Meinhardt (1972) & Meinhardt (1993) Hydra vulgaris activator-inhibitor morphogenesis, head regeneration & tentacle ring — MorphoEval overall 91.8/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 2 (v2) evaluation of `1972-gierer-hydra-activator-inhibitor.py` (91.6/100, up +36.6 from 55.0/100 in Pass 1). The remediated script implements Gierer & Meinhardt's (1972) Eqs. (15a)-(15b) short-range autocatalytic activator (a^2/h) and long-range inhibitor PDE, exact Jacobian & dispersion analysis (d_c = (sqrt(2)+1)^2 = 5.8284), intact apical hypostome dominance (x=0, a_max=9.53) and surgical bisection head regeneration of the amputated basal half (87.4% peak recovery, 161x amplification over pre-cut laterally inhibited tissue), Meinhardt's (1993) periodic sub-hypostomal tentacle ring (6 peaks, CV=0.0442) paired with an equal-diffusion negative control (D_a=D_h=0.015, 0 peaks, std=1.80e-15), a 6-point diffusivity-ratio sweep across d_c, an allometric domain-scaling sweep (r=0.9823), and automated computer-vision segmentation of the 6 tentacles and body-column axis of the vendored Hydra vulgaris specimen. Overall 91.8/100 (faithfulness 91.2, reproducibility 93.0); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 3cb5ea9; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 94, Morphological realism / specimen match 90, Parameter expressivity 89, Morphometric validation 91, Source and data traceability 95, Code-to-model traceability 92, Reproducibility package 92. Output judged: docs/media/hydra_activator_inhibitor_comparison.png: rendered output of 1972-gierer-hydra-activator-inhibitor.py at 3cb5ea9, image/png, 953650 B, 2227×1822 px, artifact_sha256 f389b2907ee3f9c74dcbe9f948d8d4e34915be743c71767efab12a54dd25951c (sha256 f389b2907ee3f9c74dcbe9f948d8d4e34915be743c71767efab12a54dd25951c), spec_fingerprint c9d51c7c93ac67b33d6bf4ce3308cc6670cda412367b820e85de0adf71aa9719. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: c9d51c7c93ac67b33d6bf4ce3308cc6670cda412367b820e85de0adf71aa9719; artifact_sha256: f389b2907ee3f9c74dcbe9f948d8d4e34915be743c71767efab12a54dd25951c; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/hydra_activator_inhibitor/hydra_activator_inhibitor_reference.json=f9d8a0be5130d952..., datasets/hydra_activator_inhibitor/hydra_vulgaris_specimen.jpg=007d127bcfa8501d..., datasets/hydra_activator_inhibitor/paper_citations.bib=49b5c0a5531a00fe..., datasets/hydra_activator_inhibitor/scout_manifest.json=b57d0d923283daaf...}. Supersedes audit: 2026-10-19-hydra-activator-inhibitor-audit." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Extend the 1D apico-basal column and circular tentacle ring to a coupled 3D cylindrical shell finite-element surface with separate head-activator, tentacle-activator, and foot-activator loops (Meinhardt 1993, 2012)." ;
    pk:hasScore 9.18e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-gierer-hydra-activator-inhibitor-parameter-expressivity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Gierer & Meinhardt (1972) & Meinhardt (1993) Hydra vulgaris activator-inhibitor morphogenesis, head regeneration & tentacle ring — Parameter expressivity: 89/100" ;
